---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
import SiteNav from "../components/SiteNav.astro";
import SiteFooter from "../components/SiteFooter.astro";
const title = "Privacy and Data Handling | Arkansas Automated";
const description = "How Arkansas Automated handles information submitted through this website.";
---
<Base title={title} description={description} path="/privacy">
  <SiteNav />
  <main><section class="section"><div class="container article-body">
    <p class="crumbs"><a href="/">Home</a><span>/</span><span>Privacy</span></p>
    <h1 class="heading-lg">Privacy and data handling</h1>
    <p class="fine-print">Last updated August 15, 2026</p>
    <p>This page explains the information the public website collects and why.</p>
    <h2 class="heading-md">Information you submit</h2>
    <p>Request forms may collect your business name, name, work email, phone number, industry, current tools, workshop preference, and the problem you want addressed. We use this information to respond to your request and evaluate the requested service.</p>
    <h2 class="heading-md">Request context and site measurement</h2>
    <p>The site may attach the page you visited, referral source, campaign parameters, selected request type, and basic form-interaction timing to a successful submission. It also records a page view after the page remains visible briefly. This information helps us understand which pages lead to relevant conversations and identify obvious automated traffic.</p>
    <h2 class="heading-md">Service providers</h2>
    <p>The website is hosted by Vercel. Form submissions and first-party page-view events are sent to infrastructure operated with Fort Smith Directory for Arkansas Automated. These providers process information to host the site and deliver requests; they are not presented here as independent marketing lists.</p>
    <h2 class="heading-md">Cookies and browser storage</h2>
    <p>The current site uses session storage to avoid counting repeated views of the same path in one browser tab session. It does not require an advertising cookie to submit a request.</p>
    <h2 class="heading-md">Your choices</h2>
    <p>You may contact <a class="text-link" href="mailto:dre@arkansasautomated.com">dre@arkansasautomated.com</a> to ask about information you submitted or request a correction or deletion. We may retain information where reasonably needed for security, recordkeeping, or legal obligations.</p>
    <h2 class="heading-md">Sensitive information</h2>
    <p>Do not submit patient information, legal case details, financial account data, passwords, or other sensitive personal information through the public request forms.</p>
  </div></section></main>
  <SiteFooter />
</Base>
